{"id":"25913aadd8739feb","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-normal-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Normal Ideal","display":"df-zfc-normal-ideal — ZFC Normal Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-normal-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-normal-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-normal-ideal — ZFC Normal Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ideal]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-normal-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-normal-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-normal-ideal — ZFC Normal Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\kappa,\\vec A\\in V\">\\(I,\\kappa,\\vec A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\kappa\\notin I\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\in I)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\;(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in I)\\land \\forall\\vec A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,I)\\to\\{\\xi&lt;\\kappa\\mid\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\xi\\;(\\xi\\in\\vec A(\\alpha))\\}\\in I\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\kappa\\notin I\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\in I)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\;(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in I)\\land \\forall\\vec A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,I)\\to\\{\\xi&lt;\\kappa\\mid\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\xi\\;(\\xi\\in\\vec A(\\alpha))\\}\\in I\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span>; the ideal is proper, contains all singletons, is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete, and is closed under diagonal unions of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-sequences.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}$ (ideal predicate, see [[58-df-ideal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"I,\\kappa,\\vec A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\kappa\\notin I\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\in I)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\;(|\\mathcal A|<\\kappa\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in I)\\land \\forall\\vec A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,I)\\to\\{\\xi<\\kappa\\mid\\exists\\alpha<\\xi\\;(\\xi\\in\\vec A(\\alpha))\\}\\in I\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1390,"backlinks":[{"id":"92588a6191abc58b","anchor":"ref-1","locations